{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catlite</strong> is in <strong>Development</strong>! This page contents will be continually updated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/e31120b4855f42ed0c82d54ba7f07d68.poster.avif?t=1774278597\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/e31120b4855f42ed0c82d54ba7f07d68.webm?t=1774278597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/e31120b4855f42ed0c82d54ba7f07d68.mp4?t=1774278597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In this <strong>Roguelite</strong> <strong>Shooter</strong> you must <strong>fight</strong> evil <strong>Mutant Rats</strong> and <strong>Save the Cats</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Great Rodent Outburst, the cats are struggling to survive in a world dominated by nasty mutant rats. But that's where Catlite comes in! An adorable machine of destruction created by the genius Dr. Cattus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight through the hordes of rats to find and rescue surviving cats scattered throughout the cities, sewers and eerie rat laboratories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help the <strong>Feline</strong> <strong>Resistance</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/95e7350590092848b7688a30c64d8ab8.poster.avif?t=1774278597\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/95e7350590092848b7688a30c64d8ab8.webm?t=1774278597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/95e7350590092848b7688a30c64d8ab8.mp4?t=1774278597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has some kind of <strong>Reward</strong>! Catlite adapts and evolves by acquiring <strong>Boosts</strong>\u00a0that last through the mission, enhancing combat capabilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of every mission you will find and <strong>Rescue</strong> <strong>a</strong> <strong>Cat</strong> that comes back with you to the <strong>Feline Resistance Camp</strong>! That is, if you succeed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/fe52014dcc804747199778eacf654104.poster.avif?t=1774278597\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/fe52014dcc804747199778eacf654104.webm?t=1774278597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/fe52014dcc804747199778eacf654104.mp4?t=1774278597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescued Cats</strong> may provide access to  <strong>new weapons, upgrades and perks!</strong> Allowing you to become more powerful for the next missions! Others may have Quests for you, or meaningful conversations that will help you learn more of this world!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032330?t=1774278597","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/b760bfefc422203c5818a87dcf6de30f56d1fd56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774278597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/4c1a5eecc1a88e3d133e8c0f64e5e4f4ed8af5d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774278597","capsule_imagev5":"https://s